            <li><a href="#evidence">Do Knee Braces Actually Help When Walking?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#sizing">How Should a Knee Brace Fit?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#on-the-treadmill">Wearing a Knee Brace on a Treadmill</a></li>
            <li><a href="#when-to-see-someone">When to See a Doctor Instead of Buying a Brace</a></li>
            <li><a href="#faq">Frequently asked questions</a></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>

        <div id="quick-picks" class="scroll-mt-24">
